OL,3,GNEWSADoorman who witnessed racist
OL,4,Aoutburst says abuse becoming normal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doorman who shared a video of a
OL,7,Fracist outburst he witnessed while at
OL,8,Fwork has said such abuse towards staff
OL,9,Fis becoming "normalised".
OL,11,FThe footage, taken outside Ko-Ko Lounge
OL,12,Fin Rochdale, Greater Manchester, showed
OL,13,Fa woman shouting abuse and making
OL,14,Fgestures at a black security guard.
OL,16,FJawad Ali said the club-goer became
OL,17,Fabusive after being asked to move away
OL,18,Ffrom an exit while he was working at
OL,19,Fthe venue on Saturday night.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
